zip.js 2.7.73 DEFLATE encoder
Source: https://github.com/gildas-lormeau/zip.js/blob/e4933afa6825400ecc37e882964e386ccc4bf82e/lib/core/streams/codecs/deflate.js
Upstream file SHA-256: f7c6b41dc46d07b853337967a32ff3ca17b2ae649ff11d68d0cd0538bcc5da38

Waffle wraps the encoder as a classic script and disables its legacy early-block
heuristic to match the default block schedule of stock zlib 1.2.12. The source
file retains Gildas Lormeau's 2022 BSD notice and upstream authorship credit.

